    <briefdescription>
<para>Top-level audio-transcription plugin that implements IAudioBackend. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wires together:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_i_whisper_transcriber" kindref="compound">IWhisperTranscriber</ref> (model inference, injected or created from type)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_i_audio_chunk_reader" kindref="compound">IAudioChunkReader</ref> (file I/O, injected or defaults to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_composite_audio_chunk_reader" kindref="compound">CompositeAudioChunkReader</ref>)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The default constructor selects WhisperCppTranscriber when THEMIS_ENABLE_WHISPER is defined, otherwise <ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_whisper_stub_transcriber" kindref="compound">WhisperStubTranscriber</ref>.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_whisper_plugin_1a45a100a7f3c0ce6d8e757c9aabada5e0" kindref="member">transcribe()</ref>, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_whisper_plugin_1abd180b54b6014f5aaf95c54f94a7275b" kindref="member">transcribeFile()</ref>, and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_whisper_plugin_1a2004c11cf9c0e2273bee3d5dc415721e" kindref="member">detectLanguage()</ref> are individually thread-safe. Concurrent calls serialize through transcriber_mutex_ so that the underlying whisper_context* is never accessed from two threads simultaneously. Counters are std::atomic. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
